2026-07-27T10:54:17.9713036Z i /tmp/RtmpA8eiMg/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:54:17.9713364Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:54:17.9713796Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:54:17.9714133Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:54:17.9714673Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:54:17.9715553Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:54:17.9716669Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
